Date: Thu, 7 May 2026 15:56:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] IZPACK-1820 Adds path traversal checks

- Adds traversal checks at compile & installation time
- Log out of target directory writes
- Fixes #782 / #783

Signed-off-by: Patrick Reinhart <patrick@reini.net>
